PM_STR(TrOnlineFreeGoogle, L"Cloud Translation Basic 每月前 50 萬字元免費，超過後依 Google 公布的價格計費（目前每 100 萬字元 20 美元），使用前專案必須連結帳單帳戶。每日字元配額預設沒有上限，建議在 Google Cloud 設定預算提醒或配額上限。", L"Cloud Translation Basic includes the first 500,000 characters a month; beyond that Google bills its published price (currently US$20 per million characters), and the project must be linked to a billing account. The daily character quota has no limit by default, so set a budget alert or a quota limit in Google Cloud.")
PM_STR(TrOnlineHelpGoogle, L"1) 登入 Google Cloud 主控台，建立（或選擇）一個專案，並連結帳單帳戶。2) 啟用「Cloud Translation API」。3) 到「API 和服務 → 憑證」，選「建立憑證 → API 金鑰」，複製金鑰貼到上方。4) 建議編輯這組金鑰，在「API 限制」只勾選 Cloud Translation API，即使金鑰外流也不能用在其他服務。", L"1) Sign in to the Google Cloud console, create (or pick) a project and link a billing account. 2) Enable the Cloud Translation API. 3) Open APIs & Services → Credentials, choose Create credentials → API key, and paste the key above. 4) Recommended: edit the key and, under API restrictions, tick only Cloud Translation API, so a leaked key cannot be used for other services.")
PM_STR(TrOnlinePrivacyGoogle, L"開啟後，畫面上辨識出的文字會經 HTTPS 傳送到 {0} 進行翻譯（不含前後相鄰的文字），不會傳送畫面圖片。文字會離開這台電腦，並依 Google Cloud 的條款處理，會計入你的 Google Cloud 額度，超過免費額度後要付費。Google 在其說明中表示，不會用你送出的內容訓練翻譯功能（見隱私權政策連結）。金鑰以 Windows 加密保存在這台電腦，不會寫入記錄檔。", L"When this is on, the text recognised on your screen (not the text next to it) is sent over HTTPS to {0} to be translated. The picture itself is never sent. The text leaves this PC and is handled under Google Cloud's terms; it counts against your Google Cloud quota and is billed beyond the free allowance. Google states that it does not use the content you send to train its translation features (see the privacy link). Your key is stored encrypted by Windows on this PC and is never written to a log.")
